.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3261121678580083400' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3261121678580083400' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1637580654"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 26, 2014 at 12:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3943185069078771505</id><published>2014-08-26T07:18:13.659-06:00</published><updated>2014-08-26T07:18:13.659-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I wasn&amp;#39;t aware Freedom of Speech was limited o...</title><content type='html'>I wasn&amp;#39;t aware Freedom of Speech was limited only to those who write [and speak] perfectly.&lt;br /&gt;Anonymous 8/25 5:17 - Insult is not a form of argument, unless you are a politician.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/3943185069078771505'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/3943185069078771505'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html?showComment=1409059093659#c3943185069078771505' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/2623459911019468804'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3261121678580083400' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3261121678580083400' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1166362905"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 26, 2014 at 7:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2623459911019468804</id><published>2014-08-25T17:17:24.139-06:00</published><updated>2014-08-25T17:17:24.139-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Ooooooh my goodness...this guy can&amp;#39;t write an ...</title><content type='html'>Ooooooh my goodness...this guy can&amp;#39;t write an intelligible article. Don&amp;#39;t quit your day job. That&amp;#39;s what you get in a free blogspot account I guess.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/2623459911019468804'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/2623459911019468804'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html?showComment=1409008644139#c2623459911019468804' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3261121678580083400' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3261121678580083400' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1907731816"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 25, 2014 at 5:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4875895555572239631</id><published>2014-08-25T13:09:30.394-06:00</published><updated>2014-08-25T13:09:30.394-06:00</updated><title type='text'>For years I have been advising &amp;quot;good&amp;quot; co...</title><content type='html'>For years I have been advising &amp;quot;good&amp;quot; cops to either clean up their departments or get out of the profession.  People have had enough of their criminal predatory behavior and there is a huge violent backlash coming.  When it arrives, there will be no way to tell the &amp;quot;good&amp;quot; cops from the &amp;quot;bad&amp;quot; cops.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/4875895555572239631'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/4875895555572239631'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html?showComment=1408993770394#c4875895555572239631' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3261121678580083400' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3261121678580083400' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-536365682"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 25, 2014 at 1:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7041800481503620469</id><published>2014-08-25T10:54:20.739-06:00</published><updated>2014-08-25T10:54:20.739-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;A great piece of recording - stands out...</title><content type='html'>Mr Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A great piece of recording - stands out even against the quality work you normally do.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Is there any way to help Adam Basford? A defense fund for him or some such?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/7041800481503620469'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3261121678580083400/comments/default/7041800481503620469'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html?showComment=1408985660739#c7041800481503620469' title=''/><author><name>Boris Epstein</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08194890014852776515</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='18' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/__OKAAxlni-8/S4VtikGzv3I/AAAAAAAAAIQ/xfh64cho25s/s1600-R/s640x480'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/08/why-good-cops-stay-silent-persecution.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3261121678580083400' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3261121678580083400' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1768080538"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 25, 2014 at 10:54 AM"/></entry></feed>